# Domator Mesh has no build-time configuration any more.
#
# WiFi, mesh, MQTT and OTA settings used to live here as CONFIG_* options,
# which meant they were compiled into the firmware image as plain strings --
# recoverable from any copy of the binary with `strings`. They now live in the
# "creds" NVS partition and are written over the wire at programming time.
#
# See src/credentials.h and provisioning/README.md.
config DOMATOR_DEBUG_TELNET
    bool "Enable unauthenticated Telnet logs (development only)"
    default n
    help
        Exposes the device log stream on TCP port 23 to anyone on the LAN.
        Keep disabled on installed devices and release builds.
#
# One consequence worth keeping: the build no longer depends on the
# installation, so a single image runs on every deployment.
